WEBVTT

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.120
wat verwag ons volgende?

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:03.480
(Musiek)

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:04.750
O, dit was seker toeval.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.470
Kom ons probeer weer.

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:08.993
(Musiek)

00:09:08.993 --> 00:09:10.106
(Gehoor sing)

00:09:10.106 --> 00:09:12.050
O, die TED-koor.

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:14.050
(Gelag)

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:17.210
En julle let op dat niemand
toondoof is nie, ne?

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:17.970
Niemand nie.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.260
Julle weet, elke dorpie in Bangladesh

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:25.040
en elke gehuggie in Sjina -- almal weet:

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.540
da, da, da, da -- da.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.480
Almal weet om ’n E daar te verwag.

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:32.000
Chopin wou nie daar by
die E uitgekom het nie,